##
Adopted from CodingBat

Given 2 ints, a and b, return true if one if them is 10 or if their sum is 10.

makes10(9, 10) → true
makes10(9, 9) → false
makes10(1, 9) → true
##

db num1 8;
db num2 1;

cm num1 10;
    j e mv TRUE kernel;
    j ne cm num2 10;
        j e mv TRUE kernel;
        j ne add num1 num2;
        j ne cm num1 10;
            j e mv TRUE kernel;
            j ne mv FALSE kernel;
sy launch kernel;